---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-2">Background</h2>
    <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Engineering with product intent</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
    <!-- Profile Photo Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <div class="relative group mx-auto max-w-xs lg:max-w-none">
        <div class="absolute -inset-1.5 bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 to-sky-400 rounded-3xl blur-sm opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-300"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 aspect-square shadow-md">
          <img 
            src="/me.webp" 
            alt="Sadat Mahmood Saurov" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition duration-500 ease-out"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text & Quick Details Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-neutral-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I am a software engineer and product developer focused on the intersection of robust code architecture, intuitive interface design, and clean product messaging.
        </p>
        <p>
          My experience spans commercial client web platforms, cross-platform mobile apps, and headless systems. Having worked across content design and product development, I don't treat engineering in isolation—I design data schemas, craft UX flows, and write user-facing copy to build cohesive end products.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether architecting a performant restaurant platform, building an accessible clinical service portal, or engineering smart mobile utilities, my focus is always on high performance, accessibility, and real utility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Facts Box with strong Light & Dark mode contrast -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/60 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-4">Quick Facts</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-slate-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-1">Focus</span>
            <span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold">Web, Mobile & Product Design</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-slate-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-1">Core Stack</span>
            <span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold">Astro, Next.js, Flutter, Tailwind</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-slate-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-1">Status</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> Available for work
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>